 runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 116% of normal in July to August, then fell to 46% in September to October. So far in 2026 it sat at 54% in January to February and 114% in May to June. Grid 13944 has a preliminary estimate of 37.2 for August to September 2026, and its driest year was 1954 at 59%.</p>"}
